sequenceDiagram
    title Key Take/Return Workflow

    actor User
    participant PWA as PWA (Browser)
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant ESP as ESP32
    participant Cloud as Cloudflare API

    User->>PWA: Login (User ID + PIN)
    PWA->>PWA: Verify credentials

    User->>PWA: Tap "Unlock"
    PWA->>ESP: BLE: unlock command (0x01)
    ESP->>ESP: Activate relay (1.5s)
    ESP-->>PWA: BLE notify: door opened

    User->>ESP: Remove/Return key
    ESP->>ESP: Microswitch detects change
    ESP-->>PWA: BLE notify: key TAKEN/RETURNED

    PWA->>IDB: Save log (synced=0)
    PWA->>Cloud: POST sync log
    Cloud->>Cloud: Store in D1
    PWA->>IDB: Mark synced=1